<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.5.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01655</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.5.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>b1f2b3a1-0070-4241-ba5b-41fb5ac22d3c</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1–3, factor.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(u^2 − 9u + 18\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((u + 9)(u + 2)\)</item>
      <item>\((u − 3)(u − 6)\)</item>
      <item>\((u + 3)(u + 6)\)</item>
      <item>\((u + 3)(u − 6)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis> \((u − 3)(u − 6)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(8 − 6x + x^2\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((x + 4)(x + 2)\)</item>
      <item>\((x − 8)(x + 1)\)</item>
      <item>\((x − 4)(x − 2)\)</item>
      <item>\((x + 4)(x − 2)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((x − 4)(x − 2)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(a^2 + 5ab − 24b^2\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((a − 8b)(a + 3b)\) </item>
      <item>\((a − 8b)(a − 3b)\) </item>
      <item>\((a + 8b)(a + 3b)\) </item>
      <item>\((a + 8b)(a − 3b)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis> \((a + 8b)(a − 3b)\) </para>
<para>For questions 4–5, factor using the trial and error method.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\( 4b^2 + 5b + 1\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((b − 1)(4b − 1)\)</item>
      <item> \((5b + 1)(b − 1)\)</item>
      <item>\((5b + 1)(b + 1)\)</item>
      <item>\((b + 1)(4b + 1)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>\((b + 1)(4b + 1)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(30x^2 − 53xy − 21y^2\)
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((3x + y)(10x − 21y)\)</item>
      <item>\((15x + y)(2x − 21y)\)</item>
      <item>\((5x + y)(6x − 21y)\)</item>
      <item>\((3x − y)(10x − 21y)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>\((3x + y)(10x − 21y)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>Factor completely using the “\(ac\)” method: \(4y^2 + 8y + 3\).
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((2y − 1)(2y − 3)\)</item>
      <item>\((2y + 1)(2y + 3)\)</item>
      <item>\((2y − 1)(2y + 3)\)</item>
      <item>\((2y + 1)(2y − 3)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((2y + 1)(2y + 3)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>Factor completely using the “\(ac\)” method: \(18w^2 − 39w + 18\).
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \((9w − 2)(2w − 3)\) </item>
      <item>\( 3(3w − 2)(2w − 3)\) </item>
      <item> \(3(3w + 2)(2w + 3)\) </item>
      <item> \(3(3w + 2)(2w − 3)\) </item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>\( 3(3w − 2)(2w − 3)\) </para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>Factor by substitution: \(h^4 + 4h^2 − 12\).
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item> \((h^2 + 2)(h^2 − 6)\)</item>
      <item> \((h − 2)(h + 6)\)</item>
      <item> \((h + 2)(h − 6)\)</item>
      <item> \((h^2 − 2)(h^2 + 6)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((h^2 − 2)(h^2 + 6)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>Factor by substitution: \((y − 4)^2 + 8(y − 4) + 15\).
    </item></list>
<list>
      <item>\((y + 1)^2\) </item>
      <item>\((y + 5)(y + 3)\)</item>
      <item>\((y − 1)(y + 1)\)</item>
      <item>\((y − 5)(y − 3)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((y − 1)(y + 1)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>Factor using any method: \(13z^2 + 39z − 26\).</item></list>
<list>
      <item>\(13(2z + 1)(z + 2)\)</item>
      <item>\(13(2z − 1)(z + 2)\)</item>
      <item>\(13(2z + 1)(z − 2)\)</item>
      <item>\(13(z^2 + 3z - 2)\)</item>
    </list>
  

<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(13(z^2 + 3z - 2)\)</para></section>
</content>
</document>
